WEBVTT

00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:08.878
[Knuckles]
"Just chilling. Watching TV."

00:00:09.939 --> 00:00:11.358
Dot, dot, dot.

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:14.179
Dot, dot, dot.

00:00:14.979 --> 00:00:16.538
Dot, dot, dot.

00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:18.659
Dot, dot, dot.

00:00:19.278 --> 00:00:21.499
Dot, dot, dot.

00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:23.298
Doctor,

00:00:24.398 --> 00:00:26.479
why are we working
with this imbecile?

00:00:27.798 --> 00:00:32.358
Because that simpleminded
space trash is the key
to something extraordinary.

00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:35.979
Something to help you
get revenge on the hedgehog.

00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:37.659
Think bigger, Stone.

00:00:38.159 --> 00:00:41.119
The emerald he seeks
could power my wildest designs.

00:00:41.878 --> 00:00:43.918
My genius wouldn't
just be recognized on Earth.

00:00:44.158 --> 00:00:46.778
It would spread virally
to every corner of the galaxy,

00:00:47.258 --> 00:00:50.378
allowing me to harness
all the negative forces
of the universe

00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:53.238
and commune
with Darkness itself.

00:00:53.598 --> 00:00:55.959
Wow.
That sounds big.

00:00:56.498 --> 00:00:59.658
It's been on
my vision board for years.
It's the Law of Attraction.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:00.979
Didn't you see The Secret?
[chuckles]

00:01:01.132 --> 00:01:04.060
Kaplooey!

00:01:04.213 --> 00:01:05.703
Kaplooey.

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:09.238
"Another boring night
at home."

00:01:09.439 --> 00:01:10.818
The hedgehog has returned home!

00:01:11.418 --> 00:01:14.479
Falsa.
Which is Latin for "wrong-o."

00:01:15.378 --> 00:01:19.979
According to my
worldwide network cell tower
triangulation, he's lying,

00:01:20.119 --> 00:01:21.398
all the way

00:01:22.338 --> 00:01:26.298
from the majestic hinterlands
of Eastern Siberia.

00:01:27.698 --> 00:01:30.258
He's a long-distance liar!

00:01:31.034 --> 00:01:33.362
Kuh! Kuh! Kuh!
Nga-nga-nga-nga-nga!

00:01:33.438 --> 00:01:37.058
Yeah, there's more
where that came from.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.987
[Knuckles grunts]

00:01:39.769 --> 00:01:42.269
Tiny magic hedgehog destroyed.

00:01:43.088 --> 00:01:44.929
Now let's begin our quest.

00:01:48.098 --> 00:01:49.098
Wait.

00:01:49.538 --> 00:01:51.618
What about your minion?
The goat milker.

00:01:52.439 --> 00:01:54.398
There's no room
on the ship for Stone.

00:01:55.098 --> 00:01:57.459
I say we ditch him,
ghost him, blow him off.

00:01:57.998 --> 00:01:58.998
Dishonor!

00:02:00.678 --> 00:02:02.498
"Dis" is how I roll.

00:02:08.893 --> 00:02:10.668
Ugh!

00:02:10.779 --> 00:02:13.919
Uh, I'm sorry,
but I asked for
the beef stew.

00:02:14.579 --> 00:02:16.699
[device speaking Russian]
Your breath smells like
goat poop.

00:02:17.661 --> 00:02:20.277
[in Russian]
What did you say?

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:21.439
Uh...

00:02:21.538 --> 00:02:23.599
Stand back.

00:02:23.699 --> 00:02:24.919
Uh, what's going on?

00:02:26.359 --> 00:02:28.279
Maybe they think
it's my birthday?

00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:31.018
Don't worry,
I'll take care of this.

00:02:31.599 --> 00:02:33.379
Okay, everybody,
take it easy.

00:02:33.479 --> 00:02:35.319
I'm sure there's
a perfectly good explanation

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:37.419
for whatever my friend said
or did.

00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:40.655
[device speaking Russian]
Stand back. I just farted.

00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:42.579
[all muttering]

00:02:42.709 --> 00:02:44.590
[whimpers]
[yelps]

00:02:44.722 --> 00:02:46.078
[all gasp]

00:02:46.209 --> 00:02:47.209
Uh... meow?

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:50.158
[in Russian]
Throw these monsters
in the fire!

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:52.510
[crowd cheering]

00:02:54.078 --> 00:02:55.658
Oh, no, no.
Come on, guys.

00:02:55.899 --> 00:02:57.118
Take it easy.
Let's talk this through.

00:02:57.578 --> 00:02:58.578
Let's talk
this through!

00:02:58.684 --> 00:03:00.010
[whimpering]

00:03:00.118 --> 00:03:02.359
Come on, come on.
Scanning Siberian customs.

00:03:02.718 --> 00:03:04.258
There's got to be
something in here.

00:03:04.359 --> 00:03:05.859
[Sonic]
Tails, whatever you're doing,
do it fast.

00:03:06.359 --> 00:03:07.439
Ooh! I think I got it!

00:03:07.543 --> 00:03:09.785
Pivonka! Pivonka!

00:03:09.888 --> 00:03:12.165
Pivonka!

00:03:14.753 --> 00:03:17.065
Oh? Pivonka?

00:03:17.168 --> 00:03:20.170
[crowd murmuring] Pivonka.

00:03:39.629 --> 00:03:40.629
Da.

00:03:40.777 --> 00:03:42.218
Pivonka!

00:03:42.368 --> 00:03:43.859
[all cheering]

00:03:44.009 --> 00:03:46.209
Tails, what's
a "pivonka"?

00:03:46.489 --> 00:03:49.229
It's a Siberian custom
to resolve disputes.

00:03:49.389 --> 00:03:52.149
If we win, they let us go.
If we lose...

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:53.234
[both scream]

00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:55.489
[shouting]

00:03:55.575 --> 00:03:57.003
[shouts in Russian]

00:03:57.089 --> 00:04:00.828
Okay, we have to grab the map
and get out of here.
Where's the map?

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:04.268
Oh, no. I left it
on the table! Look!

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.292
[cheering, applause]

00:04:11.394 --> 00:04:13.168
What?

00:04:18.795 --> 00:04:21.864
[up-tempo music playing]

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:28.003
[music increases tempo]

00:04:30.015 --> 00:04:31.993
[crowd cheering,
clapping rhythmically]

00:04:35.779 --> 00:04:38.379
Oh, my God,
it's a dance fight.

00:04:40.039 --> 00:04:41.899
Sonic,
what do we do?

00:04:42.199 --> 00:04:44.539
We dance
and get that map.

00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:47.119
Here we go.

00:04:47.195 --> 00:04:48.423
[grunts] Ow!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:49.601
[crowd jeering]

00:04:49.678 --> 00:04:51.838
Okay, now let's do--
No, we're gonna go--
[grunts]

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.741
[grunts] Ah, okay.
[grunts]

00:05:09.129 --> 00:05:10.949
Okay,
this is not going well.

00:05:11.054 --> 00:05:13.483
Channing Tatum
makes it look so easy.

00:05:13.589 --> 00:05:14.629
Wait, Sonic. Look!

00:05:15.344 --> 00:05:19.536
[crowd] Opa! Opa! Opa!

00:05:19.643 --> 00:05:21.686
The map!
Come on, let's grab it!

00:05:25.698 --> 00:05:26.881
You want?

00:05:27.598 --> 00:05:28.638
Come get.

00:05:28.746 --> 00:05:30.901
Freaks!
[crowd jeering]

00:05:31.009 --> 00:05:32.122
Freaks!

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.781
[all chanting]
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

00:05:34.888 --> 00:05:37.115
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

00:05:37.224 --> 00:05:39.379
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

00:05:39.486 --> 00:05:41.031
[whimpering]
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

00:05:41.139 --> 00:05:43.819
[gasps]
What's wrong, Tails?
Come on. I need you!

00:05:44.079 --> 00:05:46.779
I can't do this, Sonic.
I'm not brave like you.

00:05:47.119 --> 00:05:49.599
My gadget got us in this mess,
and I lost your map,

00:05:49.839 --> 00:05:51.599
and we're gonna get
tossed into a fire!

00:05:54.549 --> 00:05:55.772
Ah...

00:05:56.529 --> 00:05:58.309
New deejay coming in.

00:05:58.392 --> 00:05:59.930
[feedback squawking]

00:06:00.013 --> 00:06:01.243
["Uptown Funk" playing]

00:06:01.328 --> 00:06:03.149
Come on, pal.
I got an idea.

00:06:03.267 --> 00:06:04.797
They called us freaks,

00:06:06.408 --> 00:06:07.729
so let's get freaky.

00:06:08.548 --> 00:06:10.548
Just follow my moves.
You'll be fine.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.019
♪ Doh-doh-doh, doh-doh
Aw, ow♪

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.509
♪ This hit, that ice cold♪

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.710
♪ Michelle Pfeiffer
That white gold♪

00:06:18.812 --> 00:06:20.607
♪ This one for them hood girls♪

00:06:20.709 --> 00:06:23.148
♪ Them good girls
Straight masterpieces♪

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:26.636
♪ Stylin', wilin'
Livin' it up in the city♪

00:06:26.738 --> 00:06:28.939
♪ Got Chucks on
With Saint Laurent♪

00:06:29.041 --> 00:06:30.565
♪ Gotta kiss myself
I'm so pretty♪

00:06:30.667 --> 00:06:32.462
♪ Break it down
Girls hit your hallelujah♪

00:06:32.564 --> 00:06:34.968
♪ Whoo
Girls hit your hallelujah♪

00:06:35.071 --> 00:06:36.933
♪ Whoo
Girls hit your hallelujah♪

00:06:37.035 --> 00:06:38.186
♪ Whoo♪

00:06:38.288 --> 00:06:41.168
All right!
Backup dancers!

00:06:41.278 --> 00:06:44.353
♪ 'Cause uptown funk
Gon' give it to you♪

00:06:44.465 --> 00:06:46.317
♪ Saturday night
And we in the spot♪

00:06:46.428 --> 00:06:47.428
Here we go!

00:06:47.428 --> 00:06:48.148
Oh! Ha!

00:06:48.148 --> 00:06:48.969
[crowd exclaims]

00:06:48.969 --> 00:06:49.973
Boom! Ah! Oh!

00:06:50.397 --> 00:06:51.397
♪ Don't believe me
Just watch♪

00:06:51.429 --> 00:06:52.476
Whoa! [laughs]

00:06:53.139 --> 00:06:54.139
Whoo-hoo!
[Tails laughs] Yeah!

00:06:54.187 --> 00:06:55.187
[Tails laughing]

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:56.210
[Tails] Whoo-hoo!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.228
[Sonic] There's a lot
of me up here!

00:06:57.268 --> 00:06:58.034
[Tails laughs]

00:06:58.034 --> 00:06:59.034
[both laughing]

00:06:59.163 --> 00:07:00.141
[Sonic] I love pivonka!

00:07:00.141 --> 00:07:01.141
♪ Uptown funk you up
Uptown funk you up♪

00:07:01.159 --> 00:07:02.913
[Tails laughs]
And big dismount!

00:07:02.913 --> 00:07:03.578
Whoo-hoo!

00:07:03.578 --> 00:07:04.578
Yeah!

00:07:11.149 --> 00:07:18.149
[music stops]

00:07:22.831 --> 00:07:29.831
[laughs]

00:07:32.078 --> 00:07:33.078
I'll take that.

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:36.758
[crowd cheering]

00:07:36.869 --> 00:07:40.066
Whoo-hoo!
We did it!

00:07:40.178 --> 00:07:42.858
That was amazing!
Way to go, Tails.

